\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The destruction of part of Rotherhithe began with a religious disagreement about commercialisation in an American desert.\
The Order of the Perpetual Drop worshipped three principal gods: Ludwig, Zildjian and Rickenbacker. Pearl, Gibson and H\'f6fner survived in the lesser pantheon, although serious devotees regarded them as so last Hootenanny.\
Very little reliable information now survives concerning the Hootenanny.\
Most Americana disappeared during the Great Silicon Meltdown of the mid-twenty-first century, when every major data centre in the Lower States boiled itself into expensive sludge. Music, literature, personal correspondence, family photographs and several centuries of cultural history were lost almost completely.\
Financial records had naturally been replicated elsewhere.\
The Order practised quake-trance.\
Quake-trance originated in the dry desert canyons of North America and combined music, industrial stasis equipment and the conviction that sufficiently vigorous worship ought to inconvenience geology.\
The stasis discs produced frequencies well below the audible range. Musicians supplied the audible portion. A successful Drop occurred when the two met somewhere beneath the congregation and persuaded the surrounding environment to join in.\
The devout interpreted movement in the landscape as replies from the gods.\
Loose gravel travelling downhill without encouragement belonged to Ludwig.\
Cracks appearing in exposed rock were generally attributed to Zildjian.\
Rickenbacker had jurisdiction over anything sufficiently deep to make worshippers reconsider standing upright.\
Nobody had ever established why.\
Religion rarely suffered from that requirement.\
The great canyon services became famous.\
During particularly successful Drops, cliff faces hummed, stones bounced in place and parked vehicles slowly changed lanes without starting their engines.\
Tourists arrived.\
Tourists attracted entrepreneurs.\
Before long, resorts were selling Authentic Perpetual Drop Experiences complete with ceremonial ear protection, vibration-adjusted chakra alignment and decorative stasis discs connected to nothing more dangerous than a gift shop.\
Canyon landlords introduced resonance premiums.\
Wellness chains developed quake-trance packages for couples.\
One retreat advertised a Guaranteed Spiritual Tremor every forty-five minutes, weather permitting.\
The Order endured this until a chain of luxury resorts trademarked 
\f1\i The Drop Within\'99
\f0\i0 .\
The American desert was declared spiritually overdeveloped.\
The faithful began searching for somewhere the gods had yet to be franchised.\
They found Goa.\
More precisely, they found a bankrupt trance ashram whose previous owners had failed to monetise enlightenment.\
The property offered sea views, permissive neighbours, a large performance chamber and enough electrical infrastructure to commit theological negligence on an industrial scale.\
Traditionalists objected.\
Quake-trance belonged to dry rock.\
Goa contained monsoon water, saturated laterite, estuarine mud, humid air and an Arabian Sea of sufficient size to qualify as doctrinally suspicious.\
The Order announced the birth of Wet Quake-Trance.\
Older devotees called it heresy until tickets sold out.\
Wet Quake-Trance proved unexpectedly successful.\
A desert canyon behaved like an enormous sounding board.\
Goa behaved like an enormous wet thing nobody fully understood.\
The saturated ground, groundwater, tidal channels and estuarine mud accepted the deep frequencies from the spinning discs and passed them around with enthusiasm.\
Floors moved gently.\
Coconut palms shivered without wind.\
Standing water developed concentric ripples.\
The estuary occasionally produced waves travelling in directions unavailable to ordinary water.\
The congregation regarded these as increasingly sophisticated replies from Ludwig, Zildjian and Rickenbacker.\
Fridge Force later regarded them as warning signs.\
The service which destroyed Rotherhithe was remembered by the Order as one of the finest in its history.\
Several industrial stasis discs were brought into a highly coherent state. The chamber vibrated. The ground joined in. The estuary answered.\
Survivors later described the experience as the closest humanity had ever come to hearing the universe clear its throat.\
Goa had a memorable evening.\
Rotherhithe slid into the Thames.\
The first reports from London caused understandable confusion.\
There was no stasis facility at Rotherhithe.\
There was no experimental programme.\
There had been no industrial accident nearby.\
A substantial portion of a London district had simply begun behaving as though an invisible machine had taken offence to it.\
The Thames complicated matters.\
For several minutes, the river developed a hump.\
Water accumulated above its normal level without displaying any immediate interest in going elsewhere. Boats on either side adopted angles unavailable in their operating manuals.\
Tide gauges briefly reported two high tides occupying the same stretch of river at once.\
The Port Authority rejected the readings because its software permitted only one Thames.\
Then the hump let go.\
At least one sightseeing vessel finished on the roof of a riverside car park.\
Its recorded commentary continued throughout because the ticket terms contained no provision for geological ascension.\
Fridge Force initially saw no reason to connect any of this with a religious dance event several thousand kilometres away.\
Neither did the British authorities.\
Neither did the Indian authorities.\
The Order of the Perpetual Drop did, although its preferred explanation involved Rickenbacker having become unusually receptive to overseas worship.\
It took Fridge Force nearly a year, three international investigations and a quantity of mathematics considered cruel even by physicists to prove that the Goa service and the Rotherhithe collapse were the same event.\
The stasis fields in Goa had reached sufficient coherence to behave as one system.\
Their strongest physical effect had manifested thousands of kilometres away.\
Rotherhithe became Fridge Force shorthand for the entire class of hazard.\
The Order of the Perpetual Drop called the service a triumph.\
Ticket sales increased.\
